	(descr "Miniature (SMPW) thermocouple PCB socket, horizontal, Omega PCC-SMP and clones (PCC-SMP-CV-K). Holes from the Omega PCC-SMP drawing: 4x d1.77 mm; contact legs 13.7 mm apart, bracket legs 15.7 mm apart, 13.5 mm between the rows. Plug enters from -X; front face 18.3 mm from the contact row (scaled from the drawing, check on a real part). Pad 1 = +, pad 2 = -, MP = mounting bracket (tie to the isothermal copper).")
